OL,3,GNEWSADual carriageway to reopen
OL,4,Afollowing wildfire closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dual carriageway at the heart of a
OL,7,Fwildfire is to reopen almost two weeks
OL,8,Fafter it was shut.
OL,10,FA major incident was declared after a
OL,11,Fvan fire on the A31 near Ringwood on 9
OL,12,FAugust went on to destroy about 1.6 sq
OL,13,Fkm (0.6 sq miles) of heathland.
OL,15,FThe dual carriageway has been closed
OL,16,Fsince the fire started but National
OL,17,FHighways has now confirmed the main
OL,18,Froute between Bournemouth and
OL,19,FSouthampton will reopen on Saturday
OL,20,Fmorning.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
