OL,3,GNEWSADual carriageway to reopen
OL,4,Afollowing wildfire closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has completed resurfacing the
OL,7,Fcarriageway, installed 800m (2,624ft)
OL,8,Fof new safety barriers, and replaced
OL,9,F1,500m (4,921ft) of boundary fencing,
OL,10,Fit said.
